Package: corosync
Architecture: linux-any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 libcorosync-common4 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libibverbs1 | libcorosync-common4,
Description: Standards-based cluster framework (daemons and utilities)
 Corosync is a group communication system with features for implementing
 high availability within applications.
 .
 This package contains the Corosync executive, utilities, and default
 configuration files.
 .
 This build is the yohaya/corosync stability fork based on v3.1.10 with:
  - 13 assert() crash points replaced with graceful degradation
  - TODO memory leak in retrans_message_queue drain loop fixed
  - assembly_list_free unbounded growth capped (15 GiB RSS fix)
  - cpg.c alloca() stack overflow fixed (malloc + free)
  - Comprehensive DIAG logging: token timing, ARU stall, queue pressure
  - totemudp.c dead-write and logsys.c sign-extension bugs fixed

